"Franklin High is F City's main high school, so large it needs a campus shuttle."
"Its upper floor holds the island's placement testing facility."
"The testing room is low-ceilinged, black-walled and windowless, each desk on its own floor tile."
"Test-takers sign a System contract to cut off internet and calls; reconnecting fails the test."
"Each tile lights up and magically silences its desk during a test."
"Drones roll in tablets, styluses and bottled water for test-takers."
"Franklin High's general studies program placed Alden in Year 3, Quarter 1."
"Franklin High is near the intake complex, with a bowling alley nearby and dorms of its own."
"F-rank Avowed, who can't apply to Celena North High, attend Franklin High."
